id: god-finisher
name: God Finisher
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: true
requiresTarget: true
usageLimit: 1/encounter
# A God Maneuver: open where an effect grants it, only in God Ki (maneuvers.mjs whyNotGod). "Upon gaining access to this
# God Maneuver, create a Signature Technique" - at its first use, a new one is made on the character and its builder
# opened: Restricted - State (God Ki) on it already (the system's name for "Required State"), marked as God Finisher's
# (`signature.godFinisher`), and costing them no TP (technique.mjs techniqueTPCharged). Used once it is built: 50 TP or
# less and that Disadvantage on it, or refused, saying which (technique.mjs godFinisherProblem).
#
# "You may only use this Signature Technique through the God Finisher Maneuver, and the God Finisher Maneuver can only
# use that Signature Technique" (technique-use.mjs whyNotTechnique, via "god-finisher"). "Otherwise, acts exactly as the
# Signature Technique Maneuver, and is considered the Signature Technique Maneuver for any effects" - its Technique
# through it as through that door, God Finisher's Action and 1/Encounter kept. "The DKP Cost is equal to the KP Cost of
# that Signature Technique, and is paid instead of it" - in Divine Ki Points, as every God Maneuver's.
godManeuver: true
godFinisher: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A God Maneuver: the Signature Technique Maneuver for its own Signature Technique alone - 50 TP or less, Required State
  (God Ki), no TP spent - its KP Cost paid in Divine Ki Points.
text: >
  God Finisher [1/Encounter]: Annihilate your enemies with a holy smite.
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –DKP Cost: Varies
  –Effect: Upon gaining access to this God Maneuver, create a Signature Technique with a total TP Cost of 50 or less (you
  do not spend any Technique Points) and the Required State (God Ki) Disadvantage. You may only use this Signature
  Technique through the God Finisher Maneuver, and the God Finisher Maneuver can only use that Signature Technique. The
  God Finisher Maneuver, otherwise, acts exactly as the Signature Technique Maneuver, and is considered the Signature
  Technique Maneuver for any effects. The DKP Cost is equal to the KP Cost of that Signature Technique, and is paid
  instead of it.
